.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK WORK ATTACHMENT UPLOAD"
.SH NAME
hamstik work attachment upload \- Upload an attachment
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik work attachment upload [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Upload an attachment
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I KEY
Work item key
.TP
.I FILE
File to upload, or - for stdin
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --file-name
File name recorded with the attachment (defaults to the file name)
.TP
.B --content-type
Content type (defaults to a guess or application/octet-stream)
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
